OL,3,ASchools encourage pupils not to skip   
OL,4,Aclass after GTA 6 global release       
OL,6,FGrand Theft Auto 6 has been released   
OL,7,Faround the world, ending the 13-year   
OL,8,Fwait for a new instalment of the game  
OL,10,FIn the UK, some gamers found it hard to
OL,11,Fgo to bed after the long-awaited       
OL,12,Fmidnight release                       
OL,14,F"I have to be up for work in five      
OL,15,Fhours," one gamer told us overnight.   
OL,16,F"Why am I playing a game I have years  
OL,17,Fto enjoy?"                             
OL,19,FMeanwhile, schools are telling gamers  
OL,20,Fnot to skip class - with one school in 
OL,21,FEssex holding a raffle to stop pupils  
OL,22,Fbunking off                            
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
