OL,3,ASchools encourage pupils not to skip   
OL,4,Aclass after GTA 6 global release       
OL,6,FGTA 6, in which players explore a      
OL,7,Ffictional US state called Leonida,     
OL,8,Ffeatures the series' first playable    
OL,9,Ffemale protagonist in a 3D setting     
OL,11,FAnd the reviews are very positive -    
OL,12,F"Great graphics and gameplay so far,"  
OL,13,Fone gamer in Newport says              
